     "explanation": "Bailey cites Cowan's finding of roughly four chunks, not the older 'seven' estimate. The container itself cannot be enlarged by effort, supplements, or multitasking. The only honest way to hold more detail is chunking — bundling small pieces into larger units, which depends on prior knowledge. That is why expertise raises your effective capacity: experts pack more into each of the same four slots.",
